<title>UK: SBC sets put and call warrants on DTB Bund future.</title>
<headline>SBC sets put and call warrants on DTB Bund future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the DTB Bund future, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.SEP.96-06.JUN.97   PAYDATE	16.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  94.0 PCT    2.06 DEM	 1.31 PCT	46.03 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  95.0 PCT    1.53 DEM	 1.80 PCT	61.97 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  96.0 PCT    1.06 DEM	 2.36 PCT	89.45 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   92.0 PCT    0.64 DEM	 3.65 PCT     148.16 X</p>
<p> PUT E	   93.0 PCT    0.93 DEM	 2.90 PCT     101.96 X</p>
<p> PUT F	   94.0 PCT    1.27 DEM	 2.20 PCT	74.66 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
